                                                 7.00 – 11.00 7.15 – 11.15 7.30 – 11.30 7.45 – 11.45 8.00 – 12.00 8.15 – 12.15 8.30 – 12.30 8.45 – 12-45 9.00 – 13.00  
                                                 Min. 30 minuten  
                                                 11.30 – 15.30 11.45 – 15.45 12.00 – 16.00 12.15 – 16.15 12.30 – 16.30 12.45 – 16.45 13.00 – 17.00 13.15 – 17.15 13.30 – 17.30 13.45 – 17.45 14.00 – 18.00  
                                             
                                             
